1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,269
Look, Pip! A rainbow!

2
00:00:06,350 --> 00:00:08,815
But wait. A stripe is missing!

3
00:00:11,350 --> 00:00:13,333
Oh no! Where did it go?

4
00:00:21,350 --> 00:00:23,658
Hi, friends! I'm Milo.

5
00:00:28,350 --> 00:00:29,636
And I'm Pip!

6
00:00:35,350 --> 00:00:40,235
Milo and Pip love rainbows. But this one is not finished.

7
00:00:43,350 --> 00:00:46,512
Red. Orange. Yellow. Green. Purple.

8
00:00:50,350 --> 00:00:52,883
Something is gone. Let's find it!

9
00:01:03,350 --> 00:01:05,855
A clue! There is a picture on it.

10
00:01:10,350 --> 00:01:11,681
Red flowers!

11
00:01:24,350 --> 00:01:27,955
Milo and Pip find a bed of beautiful flowers.

12
00:01:31,350 --> 00:01:33,600
What color are these flowers?

13
00:01:39,350 --> 00:01:40,915
Red! You got it!

14
00:01:52,350 --> 00:01:53,983
Look! Another clue!

15
00:01:59,350 --> 00:02:01,264
A pond! Let's go!

16
00:02:12,350 --> 00:02:16,019
Here is the pond. The water is calm and shiny.

17
00:02:19,350 --> 00:02:21,423
What color are the lily pads?

18
00:02:27,350 --> 00:02:29,403
Green! Like Pip's scarf!

19
00:02:41,350 --> 00:02:43,290
There is our next clue!

20
00:02:48,350 --> 00:02:50,042
Big yellow flowers!

21
00:02:54,350 --> 00:02:56,303
Yellow, just like me!

22
00:03:08,350 --> 00:03:10,889
The sunflowers are so tall!

23
00:03:22,350 --> 00:03:23,423
Got it!

24
00:03:28,350 --> 00:03:29,512
A pinwheel!

25
00:03:34,350 --> 00:03:36,914
I see one! At the end of the fence!

26
00:03:48,350 --> 00:03:51,337
There it is. A little pinwheel, all alone.

27
00:03:55,350 --> 00:03:57,639
What color is the pinwheel?

28
00:04:03,350 --> 00:04:05,745
Blue! The missing color is blue!

29
00:04:10,350 --> 00:04:12,246
Let's make it spin!

30
00:04:17,350 --> 00:04:20,344
Let's blow together. One, two, three!

31
00:04:45,350 --> 00:04:46,647
We did it!

32
00:04:46,997 --> 00:04:49,032
The rainbow is whole again!

33
00:04:52,350 --> 00:04:55,934
When friends work together, big things can happen.

34
00:04:59,350 --> 00:05:02,139
Let's remember the colors we found today.

35
00:05:06,350 --> 00:05:07,902
Red tulips.

36
00:05:12,350 --> 00:05:13,870
Green lily pads.

37
00:05:18,350 --> 00:05:20,227
Yellow sunflowers.

38
00:05:24,350 --> 00:05:25,914
And a blue pinwheel!

39
00:05:30,350 --> 00:05:32,370
Thank you for helping us!

40
00:05:32,720 --> 00:05:34,314
Bye-bye, friends!

